      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "AI semiotics: cool paper suggests that AIs are strongly impacted by visual symbols in ways they do not always recognize in their own chains-of-thought. The way they react to those symbols is very different than how a human might interpret them as well. arxiv.org/pdf/2610.364...",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mziqgazkbc2x",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-04T16:08:53.537Z",
